 noC-PEN VERSiON 1.0 - (C)1994 nocTurne deSign/ORiGiN | | Playpen file mover |
------------------------------------------------------' | Ami-Express 3.xx+  |
-------------.                                          `--------------------'
 DESCRIPTION |
-------------'
 When  put  in  your  startup-sequence,  noC-PEN will search for files in each
 node's  playpen  directory after each crash/reboot.  If it comes upon one, it
 will  scan  the  node's  callerslog  and  move  the  file  to the appropriate
 conference.   If the file was not completely uploaded, it will be sent to the
 "PARTUPLOAD"  directory  of the conference to which it was uploaded, with the
 appropriate  user-slot tag (so that he may resume when he calls back.) If the
 file  is  complete  it  will  be  sent  to  the  "LCFILES"  directory  of the
 appropriate conference.

 The  intention  of  this  program is relieve users of the annoyance of losing
 files they were sending when the system suffers a crash or reboot.

--------------.
 INSTALLATION |
--------------'
 Simply add the command "PEN.EXE" somewhere in your startup-sequence AFTER the
 bbs  assigns  have  been made.  noC-PEN has no external requirements.  As PEN
 makes text output you may want to direct it to "NIL:" or to a file (for later
 review if neccessary).

--------------.
